ive after SSO. We meet again on 20 Nov for the go or no-go."},{"k":"s","t":"Skip if short on time: the detailed list of owners."}],"numbers":["today","20 Nov"],"skip":true,"short":"Summary today, next call 20 Nov."},{"n":14,"title":"Questions","who":"shared","sec":300,"body":[{"k":"p","t":"Open floor."}]}],"talk_min":25,"qa_min":5,"speakers":["Mike Johnson","Ann Lee"]}"#

